Otavue Extensions

themes/gigaviewer.js, themes/comici.js, themes/madara.js, themes/mangathemesia.js, themes/keyoapp.js, themes/heancms.js, themes/mangacatalog.js, themes/iken.js, themes/yiimanga.js (with the helpers
they share in lib/html.js) and their sites/*.json lists are ported from Keiyoushi's extensions (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source:
lib-multisrc/gigaviewer, lib-multisrc/comiciviewer, lib-multisrc/madara,
lib-multisrc/mangathemesia, lib-multisrc/keyoapp,
lib-multisrc/heancms, lib-multisrc/mangacatalog, lib-multisrc/iken, lib-multisrc/yiimanga and the sources built on them), licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
which in turn continue the Tachiyomi and Mihon projects' extensions.

themes/mangadex.js is written from MangaDex's public API documentation
(https://api.mangadex.org/docs/).
